### Manual Verification

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The LLM behavior changes (conflict warnings, planning quality, follow-up interpretation) are driven by prompt engineering and cannot be reliably unit-tested. They require manual interaction testing with the running app against real OpenAI API calls.

**Suggested manual tests** (via the chat UI or API):
1. Create two overlapping events → verify warning message appears
2. "Schedule gym tomorrow at 7 PM" → "Move it one hour later" → "Rename it" → verify cumulative updates
3. "Schedule a meeting" → verify only date/time asked, not title
4. "Move everything tomorrow 2 hours forward" → verify preview + confirmation flow
5. "I have an exam in 5 days" → verify realistic study plan generated
6. "I work from 9 to 6" → schedule event → verify constraint respected
